#Beginner: Triangular numbers--> used the given formula, to check values from 0 to upto almost root(2n) ,
if any values satisfies in the formula, i cannot be greater can root(2n) in order to satisfy the formula.
then TC=O(root n), SC=O(1)

#include <iostream>
